    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin Strategy is a retro-inspired 2D adventure blending platforming and strategy. Lead a team of skilled warriors on a quest to defeat the evil Black Dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gameplay! Characters take turns running, jumping, and attacking enemies across 2D stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each party member wields unique abilities that can be combined to solve puzzles and outmaneuver foes. Place a bomb with one character and have another light it up to destroy a wide area, or set a trap and pull an enemy into it with a chain whip!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay starts easy and gradually ramps up as you become more familiar with the mechanics. Strategic positioning and planning are rewarded!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but sweet story. Meet charming characters with their own life perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game design, pixel art graphics, and a retro-inspired soundtrack created by a single developer. Soundtrack included with purchase!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572990/extras/807c031c7161daa34583539a81dd0e88.avif?t=1742556119\" width=256 height=144 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin Strategy is a retro-inspired 2D adventure blending platforming and strategy. Lead a team of skilled warriors on a quest to defeat the evil Black Dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gameplay! Characters take turns running, jumping, and attacking enemies across 2D stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each party member wields unique abilities that can be combined to solve puzzles and outmaneuver foes. Place a bomb with one character and have another light it up to destroy a wide area, or set a trap and pull an enemy into it with a chain whip!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay starts easy and gradually ramps up as you become more familiar with the mechanics. Strategic positioning and planning are rewarded!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but sweet story. Meet charming characters with their own life perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game design, pixel art graphics, and a retro-inspired soundtrack created by a single developer. Soundtrack included with purchase!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572990/extras/807c031c7161daa34583539a81dd0e88.avif?t=1742556119\" width=256 height=144 /></span></p>",
